	(text "LJ12A3-4-Z/BX inductive NPN normally open: in front of a bolt the output goes to ground.\n+12V_P → 2.2 kΩ → EL817 LED → sensor output. External 4.7 kΩ pull-up for fast edges.\nSensor colors: brown +12 V, blue ground, black signal."
